			<div class="content" id="post-content-4246460">
									

<p>After 5 Months of work and absence and work on this, it is finally done.</p>
<p>Big thanks for conceptual and writing critique and help goes to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/acidninjacake" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4691694); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4691694&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="acidninjacake" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4691694)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/acidninjacake" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4691694); return false;">acidninjacake</a></span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1705184&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="Mortos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1705184)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;">Mortos</a></span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3118444); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3118444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="Pedantique" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3118444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikido