<p>(Phew what a list, hope I got everyone. Could not have made it without you guys!)</p>
<p>And <strong>special thanks</strong> to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lord-of-laugh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2916583); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2916583&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="Lord_of_Laugh" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2916583)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lord-of-laugh" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2916583); return false;">Lord_of_Laugh</a></span> for photoshopping the image of the kitchen. (Minor edits by me.)</p>
<p>I also want to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pxdnbluesoul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414125); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414125&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564862191" alt="pxdnbluesoul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414125)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pxdnbluesoul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414125); return false;">pxdnbluesoul</a></span> for featuring this article on the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mx9FzpzPN1o&amp;t=5s">SCP Café Podcast Episode 20</a>!</p>
<p>The idea for this came to me on the day after new years eve, laying in bed in a friends house.<br />
I looked up at their wall full of travel photographs and thought to myself &quot;What if one of these pictures just&#8230; overtook the others?&quot; And that was that. Feels good to have my first article be my favourite kind: A thing what does a thing, that hopefully works!</p>
<p>This will probably not be the last you will read of me! Hope you enjoyed!</p>
